// ---- innawoods.net selection: weapons and field kit with a documented past ----
ND_TEXT("FIELD NOTES", "物品档案")
ND_TEXT("AKS-74U", "AKS-74U 短突击步枪")
ND_TEXT("Folding-stock carbine. Handy, but very loud. 5.45x39.", "折叠托短突击步枪，灵活但枪声极响。使用 5.45x39 弹药。")
ND_TEXT("Adopted in 1979 for tank, helicopter and signals crews with no room for a full rifle. The cone on the muzzle is a gas booster, not a flash hider: the short barrel needs it to cycle, and it throws a fireball at night. Soldiers called it the 'Ksyukha'.", "1979 年列装，配发给车组、直升机机组和通信兵这些放不下全长步枪的人。枪口那个锥筒是助推器而不是消焰器：枪管太短，靠它才能可靠循环，夜里开枪会喷出一团火球。士兵们叫它“克休哈”。")
ND_TEXT("PP-19 Bizon", "PP-19 野牛冲锋枪")
ND_TEXT("Submachine gun with a 64-round helical magazine. Quiet for its firepower. 9x18.", "冲锋枪，配 64 发螺旋弹匣，火力强而枪声相对较小。使用 9x18 弹药。")
ND_TEXT("Designed at Izhmash in 1993 by Victor Kalashnikov and Alexei Dragunov, sons of the two famous designers, around an AKS-74 receiver. The cylinder under the barrel is the magazine: 64 Makarov rounds wound in a spiral. Interior Ministry troops carried it through the 1990s.", "1993 年由伊热夫斯克机械厂的维克托·卡拉什尼科夫和阿列克谢·德拉贡诺夫设计，两人分别是两位著名枪械设计师的儿子，机匣沿用 AKS-74。枪管下的圆筒就是弹匣：64 发马卡洛夫弹按螺旋排列。整个九十年代，内务部部队都在使用它。")
ND_TEXT("APS Stechkin", "APS 斯捷奇金冲锋手枪")
ND_TEXT("Select-fire machine pistol, 20 rounds. Hard to hold on full auto. 9x18.", "可选射击模式的冲锋手枪，20 发弹匣，全自动时很难压住。使用 9x18 弹药。")
ND_TEXT("Igor Stechkin's pistol was adopted with the Makarov in 1951 for officers and vehicle crews, then put into storage as too bulky to carry. The depots opened again in the 1990s, and special units gave it a second life for its automatic fire.", "伊戈尔·斯捷奇金设计的这支手枪于 1951 年与马卡洛夫手枪一同列装，配发给军官和车组，后来因太笨重而封存入库。九十年代仓库重新打开，特种部队看中它的全自动火力，让它重获新生。")
ND_TEXT("SVT-40", "SVT-40 半自动步枪")
ND_TEXT("Self-loading rifle with a 10-round box. Powerful and loud. 7.62x54.", "半自动步枪，10 发弹匣，威力大，枪声响。使用 7.62x54 弹药。")
ND_TEXT("Fedor Tokarev's rifle was meant to replace the Mosin after the Winter War; about 1.6 million were made before wartime factories went back to the simpler bolt-action. It wants more cleaning than most Soviet guns. The Finns captured many and prized them.", "费多尔·托卡列夫设计的这支步枪，本应在冬季战争后取代莫辛步枪。战时工厂改回更简单的栓动步枪之前，大约生产了 160 万支。它比大多数苏联枪械更需要保养。芬兰人缴获了很多，并且相当珍视。")
ND_TEXT("TOZ-34", "TOZ-34 上下双管猎枪")
ND_TEXT("Over-under hunting gun. Two tightly choked barrels. 12 gauge.", "上下双管猎枪，两根枪管都有较紧的收束。使用 12 号霰弹。")
ND_TEXT("Made at the Tula Arms Plant from 1964 and found in hunting lodges from the Baltic to Kamchatka. It was the gun a Soviet hunter saved up for; the pins on the tang show which barrel is still cocked.", "1964 年起由图拉兵工厂生产，从波罗的海到堪察加的猎人小屋里都能找到。苏联猎人要攒钱才买得起它；机匣尾部的小销钉会露出来，告诉你哪根枪管还处于待击状态。")
ND_TEXT("Panama Hat", "巴拿马帽")
ND_TEXT("Wide-brimmed khaki field hat with a red star.", "缀红星的宽檐卡其色野战帽。")
ND_TEXT("The 'panamka' was issued to troops in the hot southern districts and became the face of the Soviet war in Afghanistan. Veterans still wear theirs, faded almost white, every 15 February: the day in 1989 the last column crossed back over the border.", "“巴拿马帽”原本配发给南方炎热军区的部队，后来成了苏联阿富汗战争的标志。每年 2 月 15 日，老兵们仍会戴上褪得几乎发白的旧帽子：1989 年的这一天，最后一支车队撤回了边境。")
ND_TEXT("SSh-68 Helmet", "SSh-68 钢盔")
ND_TEXT("Soviet steel helmet. Absorbs 15% of infected damage.", "苏联钢盔，吸收 15% 的感染者伤害。")
ND_TEXT("Adopted in 1968 and stamped out by the million, the SSh-68 covered Soviet and then Russian heads for three decades. It stops shell splinters, not rifle bullets, and every army depot still has stacks of them.", "1968 年列装，冲压生产了数以百万计，在三十年里先后护住苏联和俄罗斯士兵的头。它挡得住弹片，挡不住步枪弹；如今每个军需仓库里仍堆着成摞的存货。")
ND_TEXT("Telnyashka", "海魂衫")
ND_TEXT("Long-sleeved striped undershirt. Light and warm, no pockets.", "长袖条纹贴身衫，轻便保暖，没有口袋。")
ND_TEXT("Russian sailors have worn the blue-and-white stripes since 1874; in 1969 the Airborne Forces took their own with sky-blue stripes. Under a field jacket it marked a paratrooper or a marine. Today anyone who wants to look like one wears it.", "俄国水兵从 1874 年起就穿蓝白条纹衫；1969 年空降兵采用了天蓝色条纹的版本。穿在野战服里面，它表明你是伞兵或海军陆战队员。如今谁想显得像他们，都会穿上一件。")
ND_TEXT("Afganka Jacket", "阿富汗卡上衣")
ND_TEXT("Sand-khaki field jacket with slanted chest pockets (12).", "沙卡其色野战上衣，带斜开胸袋（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("First issued to troops in Afghanistan in the mid-1980s and adopted army-wide as the 1988 pattern, the 'Afganka' swapped the old tunic cut for a jacket made to fight in. The summer cloth bleaches to pale sand within a season.", "八十年代中期首先配发给驻阿富汗部队，后来作为 1988 式在全军列装。“阿富汗卡”抛弃了旧式军便服的剪裁，是一件为作战而做的外套。夏季布料用不了一个季节就会晒成浅沙色。")
ND_TEXT("Type 56 Chest Rig", "56 式胸挂")
ND_TEXT("Chinese canvas chest rig: three magazine pouches and four grenade pockets (14).", "中国产帆布胸挂：三个弹匣袋和四个手榴弹袋（14 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Shipped to the mujahideen through Pakistan, these Chinese rigs were stripped from the dead and worn out on Soviet chests. Soldiers who could not get one sewed copies from old rucksacks and called them the 'lifchik': the bra.", "这些中国胸挂经巴基斯坦运给圣战者，又从阵亡者身上被扒下来，一直穿到苏联士兵胸前磨破为止。弄不到的士兵就拿旧背包改缝仿制品，戏称为“胸罩”。")
ND_TEXT("6B3 Body Armor", "6B3 防弹衣")
ND_TEXT("Titanium-plated vest. Absorbs 32% of infected damage; magazine pockets (8).", "钛合金插板防弹衣，吸收 32% 的感染者伤害，附带弹匣袋（8 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Built after Afghanistan showed that the older 6B2 would not stop a rifle bullet: overlapping titanium plates in an olive cover, four AK magazine pockets on the chest and about twelve kilos on the shoulders.", "阿富汗的经验证明老式 6B2 挡不住步枪弹，于是有了它：橄榄色外罩里是相互叠压的钛合金板，胸前有四个 AK 弹匣袋，压在肩上约十二公斤。")
ND_TEXT("Afganka Trousers", "阿富汗卡长裤")
ND_TEXT("Sand-khaki field trousers with thigh pockets, worn with kirza boots (10).", "沙卡其色野战长裤，带大腿口袋，搭配人造革军靴（10 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Roomy thigh pockets for the mountains, tucked into 'kirza' boots of pressed artificial leather: the cheap, waterproof Soviet substitute that shod the army for half a century.", "为山地作战加了宽大的大腿口袋，裤脚塞进“基尔扎”人造革靴里：这种便宜又防水的苏联皮革替代品，让整支军队穿了半个世纪。")
ND_TEXT("RD-54 Airborne Pack", "RD-54 伞兵背包")
ND_TEXT("Olive canvas paratrooper pack with outside pockets (25).", "橄榄色帆布伞兵背包，带外挂口袋（25 格）。")
ND_TEXT("The 'paratrooper's pack, model 1954' was cut to ride under a parachute harness, with outside pockets for magazines, grenades and the entrenching tool. Generations of conscripts carried everything they owned in one.", "“1954 式伞兵背包”按能背在降落伞背带下面来裁剪，外侧有放弹匣、手榴弹和工兵锹的口袋。一代又一代义务兵把全部家当装在里面。")
ND_TEXT("Gorka Anorak", "戈尔卡山地罩衫")
ND_TEXT("Windproof tent-cloth smock with a hood and reinforced elbows (12).", "防风帐篷布罩衫，带兜帽和加固肘部（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Developed in the late 1970s for Soviet mountain troops; 'gorka' means 'little hill'. The thick canvas shell with brown reinforcements went on to the Caucasus with special forces, and then to every hunter, fisherman and mushroom picker in the country.", "七十年代末为苏联山地部队研制，“戈尔卡”的意思是“小山”。这件带棕色加固片的厚帆布外壳后来随特种部队去了高加索，又穿到了全国每个猎人、渔夫和采蘑菇的人身上。")
ND_TEXT("Gorka Trousers", "戈尔卡山地长裤")
ND_TEXT("Tent-cloth trousers reinforced at the knees and seat (10).", "帐篷布长裤，膝部和臀部加固（10 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Cut loose and doubled at the knees and seat for crawling over rock, with cuffs that keep the snow out of the boots. The pattern has been sewn, copied and counterfeited for forty years.", "剪裁宽松，膝部和臀部双层，方便在岩石上爬行，裤口能挡住雪不让它灌进靴子。这个版型四十年来被反复缝制、仿制和山寨。")
ND_TEXT("Abalakov Rucksack", "阿巴拉科夫背包")
ND_TEXT("Wide canvas tourist rucksack with leather straps (35).", "宽大的帆布旅行背包，带皮革背带（35 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Designed by the mountaineer Vitaly Abalakov in the 1930s and made with little change for half a century, the wide canvas 'abalakovsky' went on every Soviet hike, geology expedition and dacha trip. It sags and rides low, but it swallows everything.", "由登山家维塔利·阿巴拉科夫在三十年代设计，半个世纪里几乎没改过样子。这只宽大的帆布包跟着苏联人去徒步、去地质勘探、去郊外别墅。它会塌、会坠，但什么都装得下。")
ND_TEXT("M56 Stahlhelm", "M56 钢盔")
ND_TEXT("Flared East German steel helmet. Absorbs 17% of infected damage.", "外缘外翻的东德钢盔，吸收 17% 的感染者伤害。")
ND_TEXT("Designed during the Second World War as a lighter Wehrmacht helmet and shelved; the East German army adopted it in 1956 precisely because it did not look like the old one. After 1990 the NVA's stocks were sold off across Central Europe.", "二战期间作为更轻的国防军钢盔设计，随后被搁置；1956 年东德军队采用它，恰恰因为它看起来不像旧钢盔。1990 年以后，国家人民军的库存被抛售到整个中欧。")
ND_TEXT("Strichtarn Jacket", "雨点迷彩上衣")
ND_TEXT("East German rain-pattern field jacket (10).", "东德雨点迷彩野战上衣（10 格）。")
ND_TEXT("The NVA printed its field uniforms in 'Strichtarn' from 1965 until 1990: fine brown rain strokes on grey-green, nicknamed 'one stroke, no stroke'. The Czechoslovak army across the border wore a close cousin, the needle pattern.", "从 1965 年到 1990 年，东德国家人民军的野战服都印着“雨点迷彩”：灰绿底上细细的棕色雨痕，绰号“一道有，一道没”。边境另一边的捷克斯洛伐克军队穿的是它的近亲，“针叶迷彩”。")
ND_TEXT("PASGT Helmet", "PASGT 头盔")
ND_TEXT("Kevlar helmet under a woodland cover. Absorbs 22% of infected damage.", "罩着林地迷彩布罩的凯夫拉头盔，吸收 22% 的感染者伤害。")
ND_TEXT("The US Army's Personnel Armor System for Ground Troops replaced the steel M1 in the early 1980s. Its Kevlar shell first saw combat on Grenada in 1983, and soldiers called it the 'Fritz' for its likeness to the old German helmet.", "美国陆军的“地面部队单兵防护系统”在八十年代初取代了 M1 钢盔。这顶凯夫拉头盔 1983 年在格林纳达第一次上战场，因为长得像老式德国钢盔，士兵们管它叫“弗里茨”。")
ND_TEXT("EMR Boonie Hat", "EMR 数码奔尼帽")
ND_TEXT("Soft wide-brimmed hat in Russian digital camouflage, with a foliage band.", "俄军数码迷彩软宽檐帽，帽身一圈伪装挂环带。")
ND_TEXT("The army 'panama' again, now in the 2008 digital print: the same shade-giving brim as the Afghan-war panamka, with loops on the band for grass and twigs.", "还是那顶军用“巴拿马帽”，换上了 2008 式数码迷彩：和阿富汗战争时的帽子一样用宽檐遮阳，帽带上多了插草和树枝的挂环。")
ND_TEXT("M81 Woodland Jacket", "M81 林地迷彩上衣")
ND_TEXT("Woodland BDU coat with four flapped pockets and reinforced elbows (12).", "林地迷彩 BDU 作战服上衣，四个带盖口袋，肘部加固（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("The Battle Dress Uniform arrived in 1981 printed in M81 Woodland, an enlarged version of the ERDL pattern from Vietnam. For two decades it was the American soldier's look, and surplus carried it to armies, militias and hunters around the world.", "作战服（BDU）1981 年列装，印着 M81 林地迷彩——越战时 ERDL 迷彩的放大版。二十年里它就是美国大兵的模样，军品剩余又把它带给了全世界的军队、民兵和猎人。")
ND_TEXT("M81 Woodland Trousers", "M81 林地迷彩长裤")
ND_TEXT("BDU trousers with cargo pockets and doubled knees, worn with black combat boots (12).", "BDU 作战裤，带大货袋，膝部双层，搭配黑色作战靴（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Cut with double-layer knees and seat and big cargo pockets, bloused over black leather boots. The temperate cloth was a nylon-cotton twill; a lighter cotton ripstop followed for hot climates.", "膝部和臀部双层，带大货袋，裤脚扎在黑色皮靴上。温带版用的是锦棉斜纹布，后来又出了给炎热地区穿的轻薄纯棉格子布版。")
ND_TEXT("EMR Field Jacket", "EMR 数码迷彩上衣")
ND_TEXT("Russian digital-camouflage jacket with zipped chest pockets and arm pockets (12).", "俄军数码迷彩上衣，带拉链胸袋和臂袋（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("In 2008 the Russian army changed into a uniform from the fashion house of Valentin Yudashkin, printed in the Unified Camouflage Pattern (EMR) that every soldier simply calls 'Tsifra': the digital.", "2008 年，俄军换上了时装设计师瓦连京·尤达什金工作室设计的新军服，印着“统一迷彩涂装”（EMR），士兵们干脆叫它“齐弗拉”——数码。")
ND_TEXT("EMR Field Trousers", "EMR 数码迷彩长裤")
ND_TEXT("Digital-camouflage trousers with cargo pockets and knee-pad pockets, worn with laced boots (12).", "数码迷彩长裤，带货袋和护膝插袋，搭配系带作战靴（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("The trousers take insert knee pads and tuck into laced 'bertsy': the boots that, with this uniform, finally retired the kirza and the footwrap.", "裤子里能插护膝，裤脚塞进系带的“别尔齐”作战靴——正是随这套军服一起，人造革靴和裹脚布终于退了役。")
ND_TEXT("DBDU Desert Jacket", "DBDU 沙漠迷彩上衣")
ND_TEXT("Six-color 'chocolate chip' desert coat in the BDU cut (12).", "六色“巧克力片”沙漠迷彩上衣，BDU 剪裁（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Issued for desert operations from the early 1980s, the six-color pattern went to war in the Gulf in 1991. Its dark rock spots stood out on the pale sand there, and a plainer three-color desert uniform replaced it soon after.", "八十年代初开始配发给沙漠作战部队，1991 年随海湾战争上了战场。那里的沙子颜色很浅，迷彩上深色的“石子”斑点反而扎眼，不久就被更素的三色沙漠迷彩取代了。")
ND_TEXT("DBDU Desert Trousers", "DBDU 沙漠迷彩长裤")
ND_TEXT("Chocolate-chip trousers with cargo pockets, worn with tan suede desert boots (12).", "“巧克力片”迷彩长裤，带货袋，搭配沙色翻毛沙漠靴（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Worn with tan suede desert boots instead of black leather: black boots soaked up the sun and showed every scuff of sand.", "搭配的是沙色翻毛沙漠靴而不是黑皮靴：黑靴子吸热，还会被沙子蹭得满是白痕。")
ND_TEXT("VSR-98 Flora Jacket", "VSR-98 植物迷彩上衣")
ND_TEXT("Russian 'watermelon' camouflage field jacket in the Afganka cut (12).", "俄军“西瓜皮”迷彩野战上衣，阿富汗卡剪裁（12 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Adopted in 1998 and worn through the Second Chechen War, Flora's vertical green stripes earned it the nickname 'watermelon'. It was printed on the Afganka cut until the digital uniform took over in 2008.", "1998 年列装，第二次车臣战争一路穿下来，竖向的绿色条纹让它得了个外号“西瓜皮”。它一直印在阿富汗卡的剪裁上，直到 2008 年被数码迷彩取代。")
ND_TEXT("VSR-98 Flora Trousers", "VSR-98 植物迷彩长裤")
ND_TEXT("Flora-pattern trousers with thigh pockets and knee pads, worn with laced boots (10).", "植物迷彩长裤，带大腿口袋和护膝，搭配系带作战靴（10 格）。")
ND_TEXT("The same cut as the Afganka trousers. By the late 1990s laced combat boots had begun to push the kirza out of combat units.", "剪裁和阿富汗卡长裤一样。到九十年代末，系带作战靴已经开始把人造革靴挤出作战部队。")
ND_TEXT("Strichtarn Trousers", "雨点迷彩长裤")
ND_TEXT("Rain-pattern field trousers with high marching boots (8).", "雨点迷彩野战长裤，搭配高筒行军靴（8 格）。")
ND_TEXT("Issued with the jacket to East German conscripts and worn over high leather marching boots, which the NVA kept long after most armies had moved to laced ones.", "与上衣一起配发给东德义务兵，搭配高筒皮制行军靴。在大多数军队换上系带靴之后很久，国家人民军仍在用这种靴子。")
