ND_TEXT("RIVER VALLEY / HILLSIDE OLD TOWN", "河谷 / 山坡古镇")
ND_TEXT("The Ohre loops around Loket's rock: a baroque square, a castle and a stepped lower street. Across the river lie a green village, spa villas, a porcelain works, a collective farm and cottages hidden in the spruce woods. Cross the bridges, search house by house, and keep a route out of the valley.", "奥赫热河环抱洛克特岩岬：巴洛克广场、城堡和层层下城街。河对岸是村绿村、温泉别墅、瓷器厂、集体农场，还有藏在云杉林里的周末小屋。穿过桥梁，逐屋搜索，并始终留一条离开河谷的退路。")
ND_TEXT("OTARU / NORTH CANAL", "小樽 / 北运河")
ND_TEXT("JAPAN / HOKKAIDO", "日本 / 北海道")
ND_TEXT("COASTAL TOWN / CANAL / FREIGHT YARDS", "海滨小城 / 运河 / 货运场")
ND_TEXT("Abandoned residential blocks and shopping streets lead to the canal stone warehouses. Search timber homes, shuttered shops and port yards; use rear alleys to break the long street sightlines, then reach a clear rescue zone.", "废弃的住宅街区和商业街通向运河边的石造仓库。搜索木屋、闭锁的店铺和港口堆场，利用后巷避开长街视线，再抵达开阔的救援区。")
