ND_TEXT("WETLAND PARK / BAMBOO GROVES / LAKESIDE GREENWAY", "湿地公园 / 竹林 / 湖畔绿道")
ND_TEXT("Abandoned tea courtyards, visitor facilities and village homes line a wetland lake east of Chengdu. Follow the broken greenway, use bamboo groves for cover, and choose exposed footbridges or longer wooded approaches to reach rescue.", "成都东郊的湿地湖畔散落着废弃茶院、游客设施和村居。沿破损绿道前进，借竹林隐蔽，在暴露的步桥与更远的林间路线之间选择，抵达救援点。")
